The final normalizer resolves color and dot products before summing orientations, intentionally keeping numerator/CFF factors attached. Later `collect_color` sees each already materialized forest-node atom. These are secondary size boundaries to measure if the direct Taylor outputs remain small. Neither stage is selected specifically by IR. #link("../../../crates/gammalooprs/src/uv/approx/final_integrand.rs:320")[Normalizer];, #link("../../../crates/gammalooprs/src/uv/hedge_poset.rs:1393")[later color collection];.

The separate local-4D lane does form U+S−US as three computed atoms, but it is excluded for the crashing direct case: its card sets `generate_integrated=false` and the direct route sets projected local-4D false, so `Forests::compute` seeds zero integrated coefficients without computing local 4D atoms. #link("../../../tests/resources/run_cards/paper_figure_b1_double_triangle_soft_ir.toml:46")[Card];, #link("../../../crates/gammalooprs/src/uv/hedge_poset.rs:1314")[route guard];, #link("../../../crates/gammalooprs/src/uv/approx/local_4d.rs:2247")[separate 4D composition];.

== Smallest useful comparison
<smallest-useful-comparison>
The completed huge run is not an equal-work U/H measurement: its localized case keeps exactly one production orientation, whereas explicit mode clears that filter and retains the full source inventory, including repeated direction signatures with different energy maps. A successful ordinary #emph[two-loop] double triangle also changes the graph from this three-loop dressed fixture. #link("../../../tests/tests/uv.rs:5216")[Explicit filter reset];, #link("../../../tests/tests/uv.rs:5280")[source multiplicity contract];.

Start with the same three-loop graph and the same audited single residue key in U and H. Compare the structure-only forest DOT (same covers, operation paths, component source sets and counts), root key/cut inventories, and aggregate byte sizes #strong[per node and per key];. The first shared input is the identical mapped `start` atom at the first IR operation. Existing size checkpoints bracket momentum replacement, loop/OSE rescaling, `series`, and final parameter removal. H\'s first call is S, its second is U on X−S(X); U\'s single call is ordinary. #link("../../../crates/gammalooprs/src/uv/approx/direct_3d/kernel.rs:563")[Existing checkpoints];.

If counts first differ before this scheme dispatch, investigate classification, replay or map multiplicity. If counts agree but one H Taylor output grows disproportionately, retain that smallest factorized branch and examine its exact cancellation/representation without distributing its numerator. If individual branches remain bounded but aggregation grows, compare all per-key byte sizes and the size of their materialized sum. A later matched localized/explicit comparison must use the same key inventory and certify `sum(selector * body)` versus `sum(body)` through the complete selector truth table before attributing anything to the shared algebra.

No upstream duplicate, lost factorization certificate, or exact unexpected-growth factor has yet been established. The next comparison is the matched single-key U/H byte-size trace at the first changed Taylor operation; the parent is arranging bounded comparisons separately.
